{"id": "EUVD-2026-101573", "enisaUuid": "0edfeb61-aed4-3117-b39a-1f0f5174af62", "description": "GrowChief through 0.3.0 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the getAllUsers handler that allows any authenticated user to list users across all organizations because the IsSuperAdmin guard is absent. Attackers with a self-registered low-privilege account can send an empty or short search value to GET /users/all-users to enumerate user ids, emails, names and organization IDs of every tenant.", "datePublished": "2026-10-14T18:48:01", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20T01:57:25", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/growchief-all-users-missing-authz-cross-tenant-disclosure", "https://github.com/growchief/growchief/blob/abb1e37a6f5595d8d105aef5871a2eeb0c22a1dc/apps/backend/src/controllers/users.controller.ts#L98-L101", "https://github.com/growchief/growchief", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/growchief-through-0.3.0-missing-authorization-via-users-all-users-endpoint"], "aliases": ["GHSA-ww25-35v8-hjjh", "CVE-2026-110773"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "816efbff-c4bb-3496-ae43-b52ab7fec289", "product": {"name": "growchief", "vendor": {"name": "growchief"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22640.3.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "08c01472-8903-3778-8b9e-89b5a646a58b", "vendor": {"name": "growchief"}}], "isExploited": false}